## Overview

img-settings is a desktop app for macOS and Windows that reads EXIF metadata from photos and stamps a watermark with the camera settings. Output is always JPEG for WhatsApp HD (max 2560 px, quality 92). The app is written in C++17 with Qt 6 and a QML user interface: a "Liquid Glass" look on macOS and the Windows 11 (WinUI 3 / Fluent) look on Windows.

These standards apply to every contributor, human or AI.

---

## Technology Stack

| Component | Technology | Notes |
|-----------|-----------|-------|
| Language | C++17 | `CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 17` |
| UI | Qt Quick / QML, Qt Quick Controls | `Basic` style customised on macOS, `FluentWinUI3` on Windows |
| Effects | Qt Quick Effects (`MultiEffect`, `RectangularShadow`), Qt Shader Tools | Glass shader in `shaders/glass.frag` |
| Image I/O & drawing | `QImage`, `QImageReader/Writer`, `QPainter` | Watermark is drawn with the embedded Go Regular font |
| EXIF | In-house TIFF/EXIF reader (`src/exif.cpp`) | JPEG APP1, PNG `eXIf`, TIFF-based raw (ARW), JXL `Exif` box |
| JPEG XL | libjxl 0.12 (optional) | Enabled when found via pkg-config (`HAVE_JXL`) |
| Sony RAW | Embedded JPEG preview → `dcraw` → ImageMagick | External tools are optional fallbacks |
| Build | CMake 3.21+, Qt 6.9+ (CI uses 6.11.2) | `qt_add_qml_module`, `qt_add_shaders` |
| Tests | Qt Test + CTest | `tests/tst_engine.cpp` |

### CI/CD

- **GitHub Actions** — `build.yml` (reusable build), `ci.yml` (PRs), `release.yml` (releases)
- **Dependabot** — monthly GitHub Actions updates
- **Semantic Release** — commit-message–driven versioning on `main`

