## Build System

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `make` / `make build` | Configure (Release) and build the app and the tests into `build/` |
| `make test` | Build and run the unit tests |
| `make run` | Build and open the app (macOS) |
| `make clean` | Remove `build/` and `dist/` |

CMake options:

| Option | Default | Purpose |
|--------|---------|---------|
| `APP_VERSION` | `0.0.0` | Version for the bundle / executable (set by the release pipeline) |
| `IMG_SETTINGS_TESTS` | `ON` | Build `tests/` |
| `REQUIRE_JXL` | `OFF` | Fail if libjxl is missing (CI sets it) |
| `JXL_STATIC` | `OFF` | Link libjxl and its dependencies statically (CI, via vcpkg) |

